WEBVTT

1
00:00:28.875 --> 00:00:32.125
In the previous verse of Chapter 15,

2
00:00:32.125 --> 00:00:36.083
Lord Krishna explained that
only the jnana-chakshushaha –

3
00:00:36.083 --> 00:00:38.666
those with the eye of wisdom –

4
00:00:38.666 --> 00:00:41.291
can see how the soul leaves the body,

5
00:00:41.291 --> 00:00:42.958
dwells within it,

6
00:00:42.958 --> 00:00:46.750
and experiences the world under
the gunas’ influence.

7
00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:49.833
Now a natural question arises –

8
00:00:49.833 --> 00:00:52.583
if this is a continuous truth,

9
00:00:52.583 --> 00:00:56.833
why can some people see it and others cannot?

10
00:00:56.833 --> 00:00:59.041
In verse 15.11 Lord Krishna

11
00:00:59.041 --> 00:01:01.083
explains this very difference.

12
00:01:01.083 --> 00:01:02.750
He makes clear –

13
00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:04.958
both make effort,

14
00:01:04.958 --> 00:01:08.333
but only those who are spiritually stable

15
00:01:08.333 --> 00:01:09.875
and pure within

16
00:01:09.875 --> 00:01:13.000
can see the truth of the soul.

17
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:16.333
Those whose minds are still
unsettled and impure –

18
00:01:16.333 --> 00:01:18.916
however much they try,

19
00:01:18.916 --> 00:01:22.208
they cannot perceive the soul’s presence.

20
00:01:27.041 --> 00:01:29.125
Lord Krishna explains –

21
00:01:29.125 --> 00:01:31.875
yogis who are practising

22
00:01:31.875 --> 00:01:34.583
and are stable in spiritual consciousness

23
00:01:34.583 --> 00:01:37.375
can clearly see the soul.

24
00:01:37.375 --> 00:01:40.458
But those whose mind and heart
have not been purified,

25
00:01:40.458 --> 00:01:42.708
even if they try,

26
00:01:42.708 --> 00:01:45.000
they cannot recognise the soul.

27
00:01:45.000 --> 00:01:48.083
The desire to see is not enough.

28
00:01:48.083 --> 00:01:51.083
Effort needs the guidance of right knowledge,

29
00:01:51.083 --> 00:01:54.833
and it must translate into inner transformation.

30
00:01:54.833 --> 00:01:57.416
Just as someone without artistic vision

31
00:01:57.416 --> 00:02:00.416
can look at a painting for as long as they wish

32
00:02:00.416 --> 00:02:02.541
and still not grasp its beauty –

33
00:02:02.541 --> 00:02:04.541
in the same way, one whose mind

34
00:02:04.541 --> 00:02:06.833
is still bound in materialism

35
00:02:06.833 --> 00:02:09.833
cannot understand spiritual truth.

36
00:02:09.833 --> 00:02:12.625
Their mind, instead of being still on the soul,

37
00:02:12.625 --> 00:02:15.916
remains scattered in outer distractions.

38
00:02:15.916 --> 00:02:19.416
The word akritaatmanah refers to those

39
00:02:19.416 --> 00:02:24.125
who have not developed discipline
and purity within.

40
00:02:24.125 --> 00:02:27.083
And acetasah means

41
00:02:27.083 --> 00:02:28.125
the consciousness

42
00:02:28.125 --> 00:02:30.916
that has strayed from its true centre –

43
00:02:30.916 --> 00:02:32.250
like someone

44
00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:34.708
physically present,

45
00:02:34.708 --> 00:02:38.541
but whose mind is lost in worldly matters.

46
00:02:38.541 --> 00:02:42.041
In contrast, those who are atma-nava-sthitah –

47
00:02:42.041 --> 00:02:44.083
established in the soul –

48
00:02:44.083 --> 00:02:46.791
can clearly see it, because

49
00:02:46.791 --> 00:02:49.666
their consciousness is centred within,

50
00:02:49.666 --> 00:02:51.416
not scattered without.

51
00:02:51.416 --> 00:02:54.083
Lord Krishna reminds us in this verse –

52
00:02:54.083 --> 00:02:58.500
success in yoga is not measured
by outward effort alone,

53
00:02:58.500 --> 00:03:01.625
but determined by inner direction.

54
00:03:01.625 --> 00:03:04.458
Effort made without inner purification

55
00:03:04.458 --> 00:03:07.083
ultimately leads only to frustration.

56
00:03:07.083 --> 00:03:10.083
But when the heart is sincere and the path

57
00:03:10.083 --> 00:03:13.333
is right, vision opens on its own.

58
00:03:13.333 --> 00:03:15.375
Even a small step –

59
00:03:15.375 --> 00:03:17.666
like listening to spiritual knowledge

60
00:03:17.666 --> 00:03:19.125
with faith –

61
00:03:19.125 --> 00:03:21.541
begins to clear the vision.

62
00:03:21.541 --> 00:03:24.291
The journey may begin with curiosity,

63
00:03:24.291 --> 00:03:26.666
but if it continues with sincerity,

64
00:03:26.666 --> 00:03:28.083
what was invisible

65
00:03:28.083 --> 00:03:30.958
slowly becomes clear.

66
00:03:30.958 --> 00:03:32.750
The soul is not far away –

67
00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:35.083
it is your own true nature.

68
00:03:35.083 --> 00:03:38.833
You only need to change your inner vision –

69
00:03:38.833 --> 00:03:41.791
and then you will truly see it.

70
00:03:46.666 --> 00:03:49.000
Sometimes,

71
00:03:49.000 --> 00:03:52.791
even after making great effort,

72
00:03:52.791 --> 00:03:56.166
you feel stuck within,

73
00:03:56.166 --> 00:03:59.750
or unclear.

74
00:03:59.750 --> 00:04:01.958
Don’t you?

75
00:04:01.958 --> 00:04:03.750
Because

76
00:04:03.750 --> 00:04:06.666
effort alone is not enough.

77
00:04:06.666 --> 00:04:10.500
I have said – only those

78
00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:14.375
who are stable in the soul

79
00:04:14.375 --> 00:04:16.750
can clearly see

80
00:04:16.750 --> 00:04:19.875
the truth.

81
00:04:19.875 --> 00:04:23.208
Without inner purification,

82
00:04:23.208 --> 00:04:26.083
even sincere practice

83
00:04:26.083 --> 00:04:30.250
can leave you disappointed.

84
00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:35.541
You do not need to do more –

85
00:04:35.541 --> 00:04:39.833
you need to become more balanced.

86
00:04:39.833 --> 00:04:43.041
When the heart is restless,

87
00:04:43.041 --> 00:04:47.125
you search for peace,

88
00:04:47.125 --> 00:04:50.541
but do not find it.

89
00:04:50.541 --> 00:04:54.208
When thoughts are scattered,

90
00:04:54.208 --> 00:04:57.666
even the deepest teaching

91
00:04:57.666 --> 00:05:00.500
does not reach within.

92
00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:05.333
But when the heart is still,

93
00:05:05.333 --> 00:05:09.791
a single sentence can awaken you.

94
00:05:09.791 --> 00:05:12.041
So

95
00:05:12.041 --> 00:05:16.125
pause and reflect.

96
00:05:16.125 --> 00:05:19.666
Ask yourself –

97
00:05:19.666 --> 00:05:21.916
am I truly

98
00:05:21.916 --> 00:05:25.083
present in this moment?

99
00:05:25.083 --> 00:05:31.250
Is my effort giving me steadiness,

100
00:05:31.250 --> 00:05:36.083
or more noise?

101
00:05:36.083 --> 00:05:39.250
The inner journey begins

102
00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:42.500
when you stop running

103
00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:45.875
and start listening deeply –

104
00:05:45.875 --> 00:05:49.041
honestly and sincerely.

105
00:05:53.916 --> 00:05:55.583
In the family,

106
00:05:55.583 --> 00:05:59.833
how you see each other

107
00:05:59.833 --> 00:06:01.458
depends greatly

108
00:06:01.458 --> 00:06:03.500
on what you

109
00:06:03.500 --> 00:06:05.916
want to see.

110
00:06:05.916 --> 00:06:09.875
If you only want to see mistakes,

111
00:06:09.875 --> 00:06:13.708
you will only notice faults.

112
00:06:13.708 --> 00:06:17.375
If you stay stuck in the past,

113
00:06:17.375 --> 00:06:19.083
you will not be able to see

114
00:06:19.083 --> 00:06:21.666
the person changing before you.

115
00:06:21.666 --> 00:06:24.875
Until the mind is pure

116
00:06:24.875 --> 00:06:28.291
and centred within,

117
00:06:28.291 --> 00:06:31.916
truth does not become clear –

118
00:06:31.916 --> 00:06:36.916
however much you try.

119
00:06:36.916 --> 00:06:39.708
The same holds at home.

120
00:06:39.708 --> 00:06:43.083
If your mind is restless

121
00:06:43.083 --> 00:06:47.791
or full of bias,

122
00:06:47.791 --> 00:06:52.333
you will not recognise the love

123
00:06:52.333 --> 00:06:55.125
that struggles to express itself

124
00:06:55.125 --> 00:06:59.625
and hides in clumsy ways.

125
00:06:59.625 --> 00:07:01.208
You will not

126
00:07:01.208 --> 00:07:04.666
recognise the pain

127
00:07:04.666 --> 00:07:08.083
hidden behind a harsh word. But

128
00:07:08.083 --> 00:07:10.166
if your heart

129
00:07:10.166 --> 00:07:13.458
is gentle and pure,

130
00:07:13.458 --> 00:07:16.541
you will begin to see each other

131
00:07:16.541 --> 00:07:20.541
with new eyes.

132
00:07:20.541 --> 00:07:24.083
A true relationship begins

133
00:07:24.083 --> 00:07:27.875
when you take off the old glasses

134
00:07:27.875 --> 00:07:32.416
and start seeing with patience
and understanding.

135
00:07:32.416 --> 00:07:37.833
Your aim should be to understand others,

136
00:07:37.833 --> 00:07:40.458
not to win.

137
00:07:40.458 --> 00:07:45.166
As you aspire to see with clarity,

138
00:07:45.166 --> 00:07:47.708
your family experiences

139
00:07:47.708 --> 00:07:50.916
also begin to shift in that direction –

140
00:07:50.916 --> 00:07:53.791
and that shift always

141
00:07:53.791 --> 00:07:55.458
leads toward something good.

142
00:08:00.291 --> 00:08:01.791
Your day

143
00:08:01.791 --> 00:08:04.833
may be continuously busy –

144
00:08:04.833 --> 00:08:08.250
back-to-back meetings, endless

145
00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:12.166
timelines, and constant multitasking.

146
00:08:12.166 --> 00:08:19.375
But I want you to pause and ask yourself –

147
00:08:19.375 --> 00:08:23.541
are you truly moving forward,

148
00:08:23.541 --> 00:08:29.125
or only going in circles?

149
00:08:29.125 --> 00:08:32.708
Just as in life, truth is only visible

150
00:08:32.708 --> 00:08:37.708
when the mind is pure and centred within –

151
00:08:37.708 --> 00:08:42.833
the same principle applies at the workplace.

152
00:08:42.833 --> 00:08:48.166
Effort alone is not enough.

153
00:08:48.166 --> 00:08:52.291
Disorganised effort only exhausts.

154
00:08:52.291 --> 00:08:56.750
Just as someone who reads a great deal

155
00:08:56.750 --> 00:09:00.208
but never reflects –

156
00:09:00.208 --> 00:09:01.916
in the same way

157
00:09:01.916 --> 00:09:04.500
you may work very hard,

158
00:09:04.500 --> 00:09:08.416
but feel disconnected from within.

159
00:09:08.416 --> 00:09:13.583
Real progress begins when your actions

160
00:09:13.583 --> 00:09:17.750
are aligned with your values.

161
00:09:17.750 --> 00:09:20.541
When your work is done not merely as activity,

162
00:09:20.541 --> 00:09:23.541
but with purpose.

163
00:09:23.541 --> 00:09:25.375
Think about this –

164
00:09:25.375 --> 00:09:28.958
when you stand at a bus stop,

165
00:09:28.958 --> 00:09:31.916
you board only the bus

166
00:09:31.916 --> 00:09:35.416
going to your destination.

167
00:09:35.416 --> 00:09:39.375
If it is late,

168
00:09:39.375 --> 00:09:44.041
you do not board a bus going
in a different direction.

169
00:09:44.041 --> 00:09:47.291
Because the goal is not just to travel –

170
00:09:47.291 --> 00:09:51.125
it is to reach the right destination.

171
00:09:51.125 --> 00:09:54.083
So do not only push yourself

172
00:09:54.083 --> 00:09:57.583
into more effort.

173
00:09:57.583 --> 00:10:00.833
Also check your direction.

174
00:10:00.833 --> 00:10:02.041
Bring your mind,

175
00:10:02.041 --> 00:10:05.541
energy, and goals

176
00:10:05.541 --> 00:10:07.666
back into alignment.

177
00:10:07.666 --> 00:10:10.291
When your heart is clear

178
00:10:10.291 --> 00:10:14.083
and your mind is steady in the present,

179
00:10:14.083 --> 00:10:17.458
you will not only perform well –

180
00:10:17.458 --> 00:10:20.500
you will also find

181
00:10:20.500 --> 00:10:23.625
deep fulfilment in your work.

182
00:10:23.625 --> 00:10:25.458
This is

183
00:10:25.458 --> 00:10:26.958
where

184
00:10:26.958 --> 00:10:29.791
true success begins.
